# Another Chance, cast twice on turn 1. First (paid by Black Lotus): Bot1 accepts and Ornithopter and Phyrexian Walker are milled, but chooses no card to return - "up to two"
# allows none, and both creature cards stay in the graveyard. Second (paid by three Moxen): Bot1 declines the mill, so the library keeps Island on top, and returns the Walker and
# the Ornithopter that were already there (cards the spell itself did not mill), both of them, two being the most.
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Another Chance
Another Chance
Swamp
Ornithopter
Phyrexian Walker
Island
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Another Chance.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Accept
? Bot1.Library.Count = 21
Bot1.Choose()
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Another Chance.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Decline
? Bot1.Library.Count = 21
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter; Phyrexian Walker)
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Phyrexian Walker; Ornithopter; Swamp
Bot1.Library.Top = Island
Bot1.Graveyard = Another Chance; Another Chance; Black Lotus
